{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/forwardevents"]}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/UpdateEvents","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardChanges"],"title":"Built-In Systems","anchor":"Built-In-Systems","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ForwardEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5EventP"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this system to hand events to code that doesn’t run in a schedule, such as a task that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays a sound for each hit. Make a stream, put a "},{"code":"ForwardEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the stream’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"continuation in the schedule after the systems that send the events, and iterate the stream"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elsewhere:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let (damages, continuation) = AsyncStream.makeStream(of: Damage.self)","var world = World()","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: -1))","","let frame = Schedule {","    UpdateEvents()","    Combat()","    ForwardEvents(to: continuation).after(Combat.self)","}","frame.run(on: &world)","continuation.finish()","","var amounts: [Int] = []","for await damage in damages {","    amounts.append(damage.amount)","}","print(amounts)","\/\/ Prints \"[10]\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each run yields the events the system hasn’t forwarded yet, oldest first, as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader"},{"type":"text","text":" reads them. Each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ForwardEvents"},{"type":"text","text":" you create has its own place in the events,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which its copies share. A stream whose consumer has stopped drops what it’s given. The stream"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends when you finish the continuation, not when the system leaves a schedule."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A system that yields each event of one type to an asynchronous stream, so code outside the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"schedule can await the events.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/init(to:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/access"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/run(in:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ForwardEvents\/System-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Systems\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\